      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">توفّدت الإِبِلُ</span></b> , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الطَّيْرُ</span>, (assumed tropical:)  <i>The camels,</i>
and <i>the birds, strove to outgo,</i> or <i>outstrip, one
another.</i> (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">توفّدت الأَوْعَالُ فَوْقَ الجَبَلِ</span>
